    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A card game adventure that challenges the mysteries of the Cthulhu Mythos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rumor is that if you reach the highest rank, you will be able to use magic in the card game Erase. The protagonist, Natsuyagi Uzura, deepens her relationships with her classmates and the townspeople while challenging powerful opponents. Meanwhile, a strange series of suspicious deaths is occurring in the town...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813300/extras/622ab5d20c66f10702d05fe2ebb7d6b3.avif?t=1755478075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Daily life and story set in the city of Kyoto</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonists' area of \u200b\u200baction is the city of Kyoto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can visit shops and famous places that are actually open in Kyoto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813300/extras/0b64df9bd0ad212956432e6dcf1c0609.avif?t=1755478075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A deep card game and puzzle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - Create chains in puzzles to earn card usage costs!Make chains carefully for a big move?Use cards in small chains?Or turn the tables with a combo?There are as many ways to fight as there are decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813300/extras/8e68a833046fdabff67557c46ee4bb1a.poster.avif?t=1755478075\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813300/extras/8e68a833046fdabff67557c46ee4bb1a.webm?t=1755478075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813300/extras/8e68a833046fdabff67557c46ee4bb1a.mp4?t=1755478075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect information and cards through growth and exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By interacting with other characters in your daily life and learning, the success rate of the protagonist's skills will increase. Let's develop various abilities so that they will be useful when it comes time to explore dangerous places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The success rate of skills is determined by a simple 1D100 downward roll. If the dice show a number equal to or less than the success rate (%) of the skill, it is a success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813300/extras/e1b96083933c11c476204c61284f1eab.avif?t=1755478075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creeping madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer you get to the abyss, the more crisis there is in the protagonist's mind. If your sanity decreases, you may become insane and be unable to act normally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may become paranoid, which can affect their communication, or they may become paralyzed by trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Madness comes with great risks, such as penalties on skill checks and forced rewriting of choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813300/extras/9cee00bbd088dad32d2010c821a464e5.avif?t=1755478075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve the mystery of Erase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, many mysteries stand in your way, centering on the card game &quot;Erase&quot;. Examine the information you have obtained and determine what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
